/T (The MLP was trained and evaluated for nine combinations of hidden layers and activation functions on the Iris dataset. The highest test accuracy, 96.67%, was obtained with the [32, 16, 8] network using tanh, and the lowest test loss, 0.1388, with [32, 16, 8] using ReLU. Sigmoid performed worst for the deeper networks \(76.67% and 73.33%\). For the entered measurements the final model predicted the species virginica.)
